{"id":3531,"date":"2017-03-19T17:01:24","date_gmt":"2017-03-19T21:01:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3531"},"modified":"2017-03-19T17:01:24","modified_gmt":"2017-03-19T21:01:24","slug":"not-a-place-wed-come-back-to","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/","title":{"rendered":"Not a place we&#8217;d come back to &#8230;"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Well, yes it IS true, \u00a0not all of our stops are peaceful and wonderful.<\/p>\n<p>Tonight we made it through Baton Rouge and are on our way AROUND New Orleans (we&#8217;re not the party animals we never were!)<\/p>\n<p>We found what sounded like the perfect place near Livingston, LA but it was booked (Crap)<\/p>\n<p>So we ended up at THIS place <a href=\"http:\/\/www.rvparkreviews.com\/regions\/louisiana\/hammond\/punkin-park-campground\" target=\"_blank\">Punkin Lakeside RV Park<\/a>. \u00a0They have great wifi (we&#8217;re right next to the office) and there&#8217;s great cell coverage thanks to the Verizon tower right behind our coach.<\/p>\n<p>There&#8217;s all kinds of little ones riding around on their tricycles and bicycles (and you know how I just <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">adore<\/span> the little ones) and oh I almost forgot to mention we&#8217;ll be lulled to sleep tonight by all the I-12 truck traffic that&#8217;s only about 200&#8242; away. \u00a0Oh boy &#8230;<\/p>\n<p>The park is about 40+ years old, the host (Karen) is very nice and shared with us that they are under new ownership and making strides toward improvement.<\/p>\n<p>This park has a large grass field that has many elec\/water pedestals but no campers. \u00a0Karen shared with us that this area was used for temporary housing for displaced Hurricane Katrina victims.<\/p>\n<p>Don&#8217;t get me wrong&#8230;this isn&#8217;t a BAD place, just not one of our favorites. \u00a0The good news is that it&#8217;s at the same exit as CAMPING WORLD and they open at 10am on Sunday, so we&#8217;ll be making a stop there to see what kind of trouble we can get into.<\/p>\n<p>We only have about a 3 hour drive today to Summerdale, AL where we&#8217;ll be staying for a few days.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3531 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-23-14-2\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.23.14-1-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3534\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3534'>\n\t\t\t\tVerizon cell tower right behind us\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-22-58\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.22.58-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3535\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3535'>\n\t\t\t\tPool was still dirty and not open for the season yet\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-22-22\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.22.22-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3536\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3536'>\n\t\t\t\tOur site for the night\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-21-47\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.21.47-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3537\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3537'>\n\t\t\t\tA field of hook-up sites for Katrina victims\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-21-16\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.21.16-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3538\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3538'>\n\t\t\t\tCamper Row\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-21-10\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.21.10-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3539\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3539'>\n\t\t\t\tThe office\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/2017-03-18-19-20-41\/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-18-19.20.41-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3540\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3540'>\n\t\t\t\tKathy got to add Louisiana to our camping map\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Well, yes it IS true, \u00a0not all of our stops are peaceful and wonderful. Tonight we made it through Baton Rouge and are on our way AROUND New Orleans (we&#8217;re not the party animals we never were!) We found what sounded like the perfect place near Livingston, LA but it was booked (Crap) So we &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/19\/not-a-place-wed-come-back-to\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Not a place we&#8217;d come back to &#8230;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,554707329],"tags":[554707331,554707330],"class_list":["post-3531","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-traveling","tag-baton-rouge","tag-punkin-lakeside"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/3531","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/her